    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Forest instead of Treetop Village in postcombat main phase. Since no mana can be used this turn anyway (everything is tapped, postcombat), the enters-tapped Treetop Village should be played now to maximize mana/options on future turns. Playing Forest now wastes the opportunity to 'hide' the tapped entry cost of Treetop Village.",
